#NEXUS

[ martz2017a_fig6: Vertical rectangular cladogram over grey faunachron bands (Otischalkian to Apachean) with the band names printed at the right edge: a time axis in bands, not a scale. Skull drawings (panels A-D) fill the right third of the image. Several bars carry three or four verticals (polytomies). Clade names at black dots and under bars are kept; 'Phytosauridae' is printed under the bar of the four-way node. 24 tips, 3 polytomies (4, 3, 3 children); 5 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 10 case (census 3, seed 20261274). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

